  data: {
    LLM: "Each turn, play one card from your hand face up onto the center pile. If your card's rank matches the top card of the pile, you capture the whole pile; playing a Jack also captures the pile regardless of the top card. Otherwise your card stays on the pile. The first capture also takes the four face-down center cards. When everyone has played their four cards, the dealer deals four more to each from the stock; play continues until the stock is exhausted. The last team or player to make a capture takes any remaining cards. Score after each hand; first to 151 wins.",
    Player: "Each turn, play one card from your hand face up onto the center pile. If your card's rank matches the top card of the pile, you capture the whole pile; playing a Jack also captures the pile regardless of the top card. Otherwise your card stays on the pile. The first capture also takes the four face-down center cards. When everyone has played their four cards, the dealer deals four more to each from the stock; play continues until the stock is exhausted. The last team or player to make a capture takes any remaining cards. Score after each hand; first to 151 wins.",
    objective: 'Be the first to reach 151 points (or first team in partnership play). If both reach 151 on the same hand, the higher score wins.',
    gameplay: "Each turn, play one card from your hand face up onto the center pile. If your card's rank matches the top card of the pile, you capture the whole pile; playing a Jack also captures the pile regardless of the top card. Otherwise your card stays on the pile. The first capture also takes the four face-down center cards. When everyone has played their four cards, the dealer deals four more to each from the stock; play continues until the stock is exhausted. The last team or player to make a capture takes any remaining cards. Score after each hand; first to 151 wins.",
    keyRules: [
      'Match the rank of the top card to capture the pile, or play a Jack to capture any pile.',
      'First capture also takes the four face-down center cards.',
      'Pişti: capturing a single card with a matching rank (not Jack) scores 10 bonus points; Jack on single Jack is double pişti (20 points). No pişti on the very first or very last card of the hand.',
      'Points: Jack 1, Ace 1, 2 of Clubs 2, 10 of Diamonds 3, majority of cards 3, each pişti 10 (double pişti 20).',
    ],
